<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112643" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύρ-ᾱμα</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is mixed</i> or <i>kneaded, dought,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Mnesim.
				4.11
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				929a25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				8.3
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				7.28
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				12.34
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
				5.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				9.21
			</span></i>, al.; in brewing, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				401.27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; generally, <i>paste,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονίας καὶ βολβίτου φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					15.2.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλάμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.55
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θραῦσμα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.84
			</span></i>: metaph., of the human frame as <i>a mixture, compound,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.184
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				7.68
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>mixture,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμμιγμα καὶ φ. ἀέρος καὶ πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.922a
				</span></i>
			, etc.: in pl., <i>cements,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				811c
			</span></i>.</div>
